From 7850fcce487bfaf12fdda0afbc2249b20bb3df21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tong_1001 <sxt1001@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 09:39:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] fix: strlen(buf)-1 underflow on empty line in
 non-standard-hbm-repair.c
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

fgets()读到空行时strlen(buf)为0，0-1在size_t下溢为
SIZE_MAX，导致buf[SIZE_MAX]越界写入。
改为先检查长度非零且末尾确实为'\n'时才去除，避免下溢。
---
 src/sentryPlugins/hbm_online_repair/non-standard-hbm-repair.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/sentryPlugins/hbm_online_repair/non-standard-hbm-repair.c b/src/sentryPlugins/hbm_online_repair/non-standard-hbm-repair.c
index abdef57654dc..ea68334c2fe9 100644
--- a/src/sentryPlugins/hbm_online_repair/non-standard-hbm-repair.c
+++ b/src/sentryPlugins/hbm_online_repair/non-standard-hbm-repair.c
@@ -664,7 +664,9 @@ static int hbmc_get_memory_type(char *path)
     }
 
     /* Remove the last '\n' */
-    buf[strlen(buf) - 1] = 0;
+    size_t len = strlen(buf);
+    if (len > 0 && buf[len - 1] == '\n')
+        buf[len - 1] = '\0';
 
     if (strcmp(buf, "HBM") == 0)
         type = HBM_HBM_MEMORY;
-- 
2.43.0

